                <invention-title lang="de">ROUTING EINGEHENDER ANRUFE IN EINER INTEGRIERTEN SPRACH- UND VIDEOPLATTFORM</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">ACHEMINEMENT D'APPELS ENTRANTS DANS UNE PLATE-FORME VOCALE ET VIDÉO INTÉGRÉE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">INBOUND CALL ROUTING IN AN INTEGRATED VOICE AND VIDEO PLATFORM</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>There is provided a method comprising defining a first routing rule for causing calls to a first telephone number to be routed to a first software service associated with a first software platform user, defining a second routing rule for causing calls to a second telephone number to be routed to a second software service associated with a second software platform user, responsive to a first call to the first telephone number, routing the first call to the first software service according to the first routing rule, and responsive to a second call to the second telephone number, routing the second call to the second software service according to the second routing rule.</p>
            </abstract>
